        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_O0_vRSwZq6hgmyv4tH_7DXoE1I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206515-southern-baked-yellow-squash-DDMFS-step-1-BG-1408-c899af24cdca48f3acb92705561facfe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206515/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a 2-quart baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place squash into a large saucepan, cover with water, and bring to a boil. Boil until soft, 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f6auPAt73qi-w6E3u4VpbpIgf2s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206515-southern-baked-yellow-squash-DDMFS-step-2-BG-1415-fcd17ae4a47841c18a22da146b5af99c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206515/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain squash well, transfer to a large mixing bowl, and mash until slightly chunky.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x_3PM6LNuP8LXKLKM6WFxf8WYv4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206515-southern-baked-yellow-squash-DDMFS-step-3-BG-1425-3493aab17a4a464fa1f35d07ca87003d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206515/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in 1/2 cup bread crumbs, onion, eggs, 1/4 cup melted butter, sugar, salt, and pepper until thoroughly combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4usTS3v9iSldmB6P-oOZiTf6_b0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206515-southern-baked-yellow-squash-DDMFS-step-4-BG-1431-f724373fbd434f33b42043df4fbc2129.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206515/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread mixture into the prepared baking dish. Drizzle remaining 1/4 cup melted butter over top, then sprinkle with remaining 1/4 cup bread crumbs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-8zK_tFA-pwi9HZSEMQOpKsgvIE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206515-southern-baked-yellow-squash-DDMFS-step-6-BG-1437-37bc9c68503340d48a6a33fa3ae621f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206515/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cooked through and golden brown on top, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
